    {
      "id": "cell-25",
      "kind": "markdown",
      "language": "markdown",
      "source": "## gelu\n\n$$\n\\mathrm{GELU}(x) = \\frac{1}{2}x\\left(1+\\tanh\\left(\\sqrt{\\frac{2}{\\pi}}(x+0.044715x^3)\\right)\\right)\n$$\n",
      "outputs": [],
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
